This project uses the official DRAKON Editor by Stepan Mitkin and contributors:
https://github.com/stepan-mitkin/drakon_editor
Pinned commit: a22609c4e5b1766c953cbfa2fa2234e69e38f9bd

Authors listed in the pinned readme.html:
Stepan Mitkin, Alexander Ilyin, Maas-Maarten Zeeman, Vasil Dyadov,
and Vasili Bachiashvili.

The headless bootstrap in integration/drakon-editor/generate.tcl is adapted
from drakon_gen.tcl and scripts/generators.tcl. Registration, callback and
printing patterns in generator/ada.tcl follow generators/go.tcl and
scripts/generators.tcl. The synthetic movement diagram uses the upstream
SQLite document format. Minimal branch/loop diagram layout patterns follow
upstream docs/AutoHotkey/Diagrams from Documentation/6 (if).drn and
10 (Check-Do loop).drn, with new synthetic Ada contracts/algorithms.
Upstream graph/tree normalization is loaded from a
separately fetched checkout, not vendored here.

The pinned upstream readme.html declares DRAKON Editor PUBLIC DOMAIN except
third-party components including pdf4tcl and Liberation fonts. This is not
an MIT license over upstream, nor a change to the status of its material.
No pdf4tcl implementation, font assets or macOS launcher code is included in
this source-only plugin repository. Upstream launcher files have separate
copyright headers that must be clarified before bundling them.

